drops to zero.

00:05:57.220 --> 00:05:58.220
Wow.

00:05:58.220 --> 00:05:59.220
So it's not an open tab at all.

00:05:59.220 --> 00:06:00.220
It's like a gift card.

00:06:00.220 --> 00:06:01.220
It's exactly a gift card.

00:06:01.220 --> 00:06:03.460
A gift card with a strictly enforced balance.

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:06.900
Okay, let's play out what happens when that gift card ones out.

